
# Sandbox CLI

Small build-and-serve CLI. One binary, two commands, no framework.

## Conventions

- Data goes to stdout. Logs and diagnostics go to stderr, so a piped run stays clean.
- Every command lives in `src/commands/` and exports one `run<Name>` function.

## Commands

- `bun run lint`: eslint over `src`
- `bun run typecheck`: tsc with no emit
